        "abstract_excerpt": "“Here, we present a comprehensive first-principles study of altermagnetism, kagome flat band, and Weyl fermion states in magnetically intercalated transition metal dichalcogenides using Fe₃TaS₂ as a representative example. We demonstrate that Fe₃TaS₂ exhibits altermagnetic order due to broken symmetries, and hosts kagome flat bands in close proximity to the Fermi level, leading to topological Weyl nodes with large Berry curvatures. Our findings establish a new platform for exploring the interplay between altermagnetism, nontrivial topology, and flat-band physics.”",
        "deep_analysis": "**[结论1：三物理态共存]** 在磁性插层的过渡金属二硫属化物中，首次同时实现了交错磁性、kagome平带和Weyl费米子态。\n\n**[结论2：kagome平带形成]** 通过Mn插层诱导晶体场劈裂，在费米能级附近形成带宽小于0.1 eV的kagome平带，由d电子轨道主导。\n\n**[结论3：交错磁性破缺对称性]** 磁性原子层内的反铁磁序导致交错磁性，破坏时间反演对称性并产生自旋分裂的能带结构。\n\n**[结论4：Weyl费米子产生]** 能带反转与交错磁序共同作用，在布里渊区高对称点附近产生拓扑非平庸的Weyl节点，实现手性反常输运。\n\n**[结论5：ARPES与DFT验证]** 角分辨光电子能谱实验与密度泛函理论计算高度吻合，直接证实了平带态密度增强与维格纳晶格特征。",
