        "summary_cn": "本文综述了球形对称自洽方法及其相关理论算法，这些方法可用于研究低维海森堡自旋模型（包括阻挫系统），并严格遵循Mermin-Wagner和Marshall定理以及格点自旋约束。该方法还可扩展至自旋-赝自旋模型，并嵌入描述自由载流子自旋模型（如Hubbard、t-J、s-d模型及Kondo格点）的更复杂理论框架中。",
        "abstract_excerpt": "The main ideas and some of the most important results of the spherically symmetric self-consistent approach and a number of related theoretical algorithms are presented. These methods make it possible to study low-dimensional Heisenberg-type spin models, including frustrated ones, with careful consideration of the theoretic (Mermin-Wagner and Marshall) theorems, as well as the site spin constraint. The approach can also be applied to the spin-pseudospin model, and is also embedded in more complex constructions when considering spin models with free carriers, such as the basic and three-band Hu",
