        "summary_cn": "本文实验研究铌超导共面谐振器在垂直磁场下的传输参数S₂₁。发现超过可逆迈斯纳区域后，共振峰出现阶梯状跳变，磁场反向扫描时形成间隔1.7-1.8 Oe的准等距跳变序列，理论解释为多涡旋进入与逸出事件。还观测到共振频率与内禀品质因数的非正比响应，揭示涡旋-反涡旋结构的复杂贡献。",
        "abstract_excerpt": "Beyond the reversible Meissner regime, the entire resonance peak exhibits abrupt, staircase-like jumps as a function of magnetic field. Upon reversal of the field sweep, these jumps form an almost equidistant series with spacing 1.7-1.8 Oe, which, in agreement with theoretical estimates, we interpret as signatures of multiple-vortex entry and exit events.",
