        "abstract_excerpt": "\"We present the results of scanning tunnelling spectroscopy measurements on MoS₂ that has been grown in situ via molecular beam epitaxy on graphene on Ir(111) at thicknesses ranging from 1 to 5 layers. We find a drastic decrease of the band gap with increasing layer number, to values even below the band gap in bulk. We also observe that the pinning of the conduction band vanishes above 4 layers.\"",
