        "summary_cn": "本文通过引入依赖于准粒子动量的有效哈密顿量，理论研究了有限电荷电流对Kitaev梯子（两个耦合超导链）拓扑相鲁棒性的影响。发现双模拓扑相在有限电流下变得脆弱，并利用体拓扑不变量和边缘-边缘量子条件互信息进行表征，为理解电流注入对超导纳米结构拓扑保护的破坏提供了有效框架。",
        "abstract_excerpt": "We investigate the robustness of topological phases in a Kitaev ladder composed of two coupled superconducting chains under the perturbing influence of a finite charge current. By introducing an effective Hamiltonian depending on the quasiparticle momentum induced by the current, we show that the two-mode topological phase, present in the isolated ladder, is fragile against a finite current flux. Our results provide an effective framework to describe how current injection and measurement processes can affect topological protection in superconducting nanostructures.",
