        "abstract_excerpt": "Topological particlelike excitations such as skyrmions and hopfions offer rich opportunities for spintronic and photonic applications. While skyrmions have been extensively studied, the stabilization mechanisms and phase behavior of three-dimensional hopfions remain largely unexplored. Here, we investigate confined hopfions in chiral magnetic films and demonstrate their precursor behavior, bag formation, and lattice instabilities under compressive strains.",
