        "score_reason": "命中TMD二维材料与moiré超晶格方向（+3分），但实验室核心为超导与磁性，该文为理论计算，关联度低。",
        "summary_cn": "本文通过第一性原理计算和紧束缚模型研究压力对转角MoTe₂中广义Wigner晶体和分数量子陈绝缘体的调控。发现压力增加带宽和介电屏蔽，驱动体系从广义Wigner晶体到金属态再到分数量子陈绝缘体的相变。结果表明压力是调控这些关联拓扑相的有效手段。",
        "abstract_excerpt": "Due to the forming of low-energy flat bands, the moiré superlattices of the transition metal dichalcogenides are fascinating platforms for studying novel correlated states when such flat bands are fractionally filled, with the Coulomb interaction dominating. Here, we demonstrate that pressure can effectively tune the generalized Wigner crystal and fractional Chern insulator in twisted MoTe₂. Our work demonstrates that pressure provides an efficient knob for tuning these correlated topological phases.",
