        "summary_cn": "本综述总结了二维范德华磁体的研究现状，涵盖铁磁/反铁磁、拓扑、量子与非平衡动力学、Floquet效应、磁子、自旋电子学以及光-声子-电场耦合（多铁）等方向。文章指出，2016年二维磁体的发现类似“打开黑暗房间的灯”，挑战了既有理论，并推动了材料、实验和应用新方向的发展。",
        "abstract_excerpt": "Scientific discovery is often described as walking into a dark room and turning on the light. The discovery of 2D magnetism in van der Waals materials in 2016 was one such leap forward, removing one spatial dimension from macroscopic materials. The field is actively evolving, expanding theoretical understanding, materials capabilities, and experimental phenomenology while opening new directions for application.",
