        "summary_cn": "本文通过调控间苯二酚-甲醛树脂的预缩合过程，同时优化了硬碳中伪石墨域和闭孔结构，无需模板即可实现高性能。优化后的负极在60 mA g⁻¹下可逆容量达349.8 mAh g⁻¹（ICE 86.69%），低压平台容量从183提升至255.5 mAh g⁻¹，并在200 mA g⁻¹高倍率下保持260.8 mAh g⁻¹。该策略在间苯二酚-胺树脂中同样有效（容量360.8 mAh g⁻¹，ICE 83.17%），为高性能硬碳负极提供了可规模化的无模板合成路径。",
        "abstract_excerpt": "\"Hard carbon (HC) anodes are pivotal for advancing sodium‐ion battery technology... Here, we demonstrate a molecular engineering strategy by tailoring the pre‐condensation of a resorcinol‐formaldehyde resin... The optimized HC anode delivers a significantly enhanced low‐voltage plateau capacity (from 183 to 255.5 mAh g−1) and a total reversible capacity of 349.8 mAh g−1 at 60 mA g−1 with an initial Coulombic efficiency (ICE) of 86.69%.\"",
